factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the municipal officials (மாநகராட்சி அதிகாரிகள், plural) inspected the work, but the reel_script and caption say a single officer (மாநகராட்சி அதிகாரி) did, changing the number of officials.
  The caption says the rainwater entered houses in Avaarampalayam and Ganapathy P&T Colony, but the article only says rainwater entered houses in some places, while the caption's sentence attributes it to those two areas; the reel_script similarly states it as a general fact about those areas, which is consistent, but the caption states 'மழைநீர் வீடுகளுக்குள் புகுந்ததால் மக்கள் அவதிக்குள்ளானார்கள்' under those areas, which matches the article. (Minor, no change needed.)
  The reel_script says 'இரவில் பல இடங்களில் பலத்த மழை பெய்தது' and the caption says heavy rain at many places, but the caption also says the rain fell 'in some places heavy and in some places moderate' under the list of areas, which is a mixing of the general rainfall description with the list of named areas and is ambiguous in meaning.
  The reel_script's 'மேலும் செய்திகளுக்கு கோயம்புத்தூர் த்ரீ சிக்ஸ்டி பக்கத்தை பின்தொடருங்கள்' closing is fixed and excluded, so no issue there.
  The article says the drainage water was removed by municipal workers 'மின் மோட்டாா்கள் மூலமாக' from underpasses; the reel_script omits the detail that these were the underpass/flyover areas' stagnant water specifically being cleared by workers, which is present, so no missing fact. However the reel_script states the flood-water removal result without the note that it was stagnant water under the flyovers and that it was removed, which is covered.
